ir theme when editor settings are changed (ie when a theme is set manually).\r\n\r\nHowever, the docs do not perform this check on the \"theme changed\" notification, so they fail to update when the theme changes by other means, such as when the system theme changes while `interface/theme/follow_system_theme` is enabled.\r\n\r\nThis PR merges the `NOTIFICATION_EDITOR_SETTINGS_CHANGED` behavior into the `NOTIFICATION_THEME_CHANGED` case so that the theme is always properly updated.\r\n\r\nFor reference, here is a screenshot of the incorrect behavior, captured after switching the system theme from light mode to dark mode, with `interface/theme/follow_system_theme` enabled (macOS 15.4, latest `master` 1f787b63):\r\n![Screenshot 2025-04-24 at 13 04 17](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/81764e3d-b84e-489f-b354-764e6eb654f9)","labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-04-24T17:08:45Z","updated_at":"2026-02-24T00:48:53Z","closed_at":"2026-02-24T00:38:07Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"Grublady:help_theme_update","ref":"help_theme_update","repo":{"id":825140021,"node_id":"R_kgDOMS6jNQ","name":"godot","full_name":"Grublady/godot","owner":{"login":"Grublady","id":29121925,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MTIxOTI1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29121925?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady","html_url":"https://github.com/Grublady","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api